		formatString: 0.0%
		displayFolder: Customer\Concentration
		lineageTag: e4751446-c64b-4079-a2d1-349eb6d25c84

Top 10 Product Sales =
SUMX ( TOPN ( 10, ALLSELECTED ( DimProduct[Product] ), [Merchandise Net Sales], DESC ), CALCULATE ( [Merchandise Net Sales] ) )
		formatString: £#,0
		displayFolder: Product\Concentration
		lineageTag: 75fd73d6-bc87-4b3c-a3db-f55ed8a5c7bd

Top 10 Product Sales Share =
